<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept housing starts up 17.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept housing starts up 17.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts in September rose 17.4 percent from a year earlier to 147,505 units, the Construction Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>					Sept starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			53,573	   +24.8</p>
<p> Rental homes			 59,780	   +15.1</p>
<p> Employee housing		    2,432	    -0.1</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   31,720	   +12.0</p>
<p>  (Condominiums)		    16,984	    +6.6</p>
<p> Total				 147,505	   +17.4</p>
</text>
